From: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] usb: dwc3: qcom/core: stabilize USB3 pipe clock and optimize AXI DMA burst streaming

================================================================================
MAXNET High-Performance Kernel Engine & Hardware Architecture Optimization
Engineered & Developed by Mahendra Mali (Max) for MAXNET Router OS
Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
================================================================================

On Qualcomm IPQ9574/IPQ9554 gateway platforms operating with SuperSpeed USB 3.0
5G cellular modems:
1. Deasserting BCR resets without an explicit settling delay causes clock glitches
   on the QMP PHY PIPE clock PLL, resulting in LTSSM link stalls and USB2 fallback.
2. Unconfigured DWC3_GSBUSCFG0 drops AXI bus utilization to single/4-beat transfers.

This MAXNET acceleration patch:
- Injects a 1.0-2.0ms post-reset stabilization delay for the QMP PHY PIPE clock PLL.
- Enables Undefined Length INCR + INCR16 AXI burst streaming to eliminate FIFO underruns.

Signed-off-by: Mahendra Mali (Max) <max@maxnet.lan>
---
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-qcom.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/dwc3-qcom.c
@@ -649,6 +649,13 @@
 		return ret;
 	}
 
+	/* MAXNET Hardware Pipeline by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+	 * Allow Qualcomm QMP PHY and PIPE clock PLL to stabilize after BCR deassertion
+	 * before enabling peripheral clocks. Prevents LTSSM training drops.
+	 * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+	 */
+	usleep_range(1000, 2000);
+
 	ret = clk_bulk_prepare_enable(qcom->num_clocks, qcom->clks);
 	if (ret < 0)
 		return ret;
--- a/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
+++ b/drivers/usb/dwc3/core.c
@@ -1139,8 +1139,17 @@
 	 * result > 1, means undefined length burst mode supported.
 	 */
 	ntype = device_property_count_u32(dev, "snps,incr-burst-type-adjustment");
-	if (ntype <= 0)
+	if (ntype <= 0) {
+		/* MAXNET AXI DMA Burst Acceleration by Mahendra Mali (Max):
+		 * Enable Undefined Length INCR + INCR16 burst when not declared in DT
+		 * to maximize AXI bus utilization and prevent FIFO starvation.
+		 * Copyright (c) 2026 Mahendra Mali - Max. All Rights Reserved.
+		 */
+		cfg &= ~DWC3_GSBUSCFG0_INCRBRST_MASK;
+		cfg |= DWC3_GSBUSCFG0_INCRBRSTENA | DWC3_GSBUSCFG0_INCR16BRSTENA;
+		dwc3_writel(dwc, DWC3_GSBUSCFG0, cfg);
 		return;
+	}
 
 	vals = kcalloc(ntype, sizeof(u32), GFP_KERNEL);
 	if (!vals)
